      "message": "Might be useful to still have a way to disable this\n\nCan we distinguish between bp2build_available not being set at all (in which case, convert)\n\nvs bp2build_available being explicitly set to false?\n\nE.g. I can imagine a scenario where we might want to convert 50 targets in some module, except for 1 or 2 bad targets. It would be annoying to have to opt in those good 50 targets. Easier to convert everything except 1 or 2 that were explicitly disabled\n\nIf you don\u0027t want to keep bp2build_available in the Blueprint files, maybe we could have a 3rd list, something like\n\nAllModules (ie subtree)\nvs\nModuleOptIn \nvs\nModuleOptOut (can overrule AllModules)",
